  "id": "cedefop-kivet-2128",
  "title": "Job-related non-formal adult learning activities with favourable outcomes (%) - AES.",
  "description": "Job-related non formal adult education and training activities undertaken in the past twelve months for which respondents indicated at least one favourable job-related outcome at the time of the interview (% of total). Favourable job related outcomes are operationally defined as: \"Getting a (new) job\", \"Higher salary/wages\", \"Promotion in the job\", \"Performing New tasks\", \"Better performance in present job\".  Other answers include \"Personal non-job-related outcomes\" and \"No outcome yet\".   (Eurostat, AES, data supplied at Cedefop's request).",
  "unit": "%",
